# Minime Alpine world (test) — opt-in diagnostic/stress packages.
#
# Merged into the world list only when TEST_PACKAGES=1 is passed to the build
# (see alpine/scripts/build.sh assemble_rootfs).  Keeps release images lean;
# test images carry the ADR 0018 stability-test tooling:
#
#   - stress-ng: CPU/GPU/memory stress workloads (phase 1 changing loads).
#   - memtester: sustained userspace memory test (phase 2 soak).
stress-ng
memtester
